{"cli.version":"{cyan}mip v{{version}}{/cyan} - {gray}arrr, it be better than npm{/gray}","cli.unknown_command":"{red}❌ Blimey! Unknown command: {{command}}{/red}","cli.try_help":"{gray}Try: {bold}mip --help{/bold} ye scallywag{/gray}","cli.error":"{red}❌ Shiver me timbers! Error: {{message}}{/red}","cli.help.full":"\n{bold}{cyan}╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}  {bold}{white}mip v{{version}}{/white}{/bold} - {gray}arrr, it be better than npm{/gray}        {bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}  {gray}Plugins, Plunder and More Booty!{/gray}            {bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝{/cyan}{/bold}\n\n{bold}{white}Captain's Orders:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip init{/cyan}                              {gray}Start a new treasure map{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip install{/cyan} {gray}[pkg]{/gray}                     {gray}Plunder packages from the seven seas{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip install -s{/cyan} {gray}[pkg]{/gray}                  {gray}SUPER FAST plunderin'{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip uninstall{/cyan} {gray}<pkg>{/gray}                   {gray}Walk the plank, package!{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip update{/cyan}                            {gray}Refresh ye loot{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip list{/cyan}                              {gray}Show yer booty{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Info:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip search{/cyan} {gray}<query>{/gray}                    {gray}Search for buried treasure{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip info{/cyan} {gray}<pkg>{/gray}                        {gray}Show me the map, matey!{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip outdated{/cyan}                           {gray}Show old, rotten cargo{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip why{/cyan} {gray}<pkg>{/gray}                         {gray}Why be this here package?{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Security:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip audit{/cyan}                             {gray}Check fer barnacles{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip doctor{/cyan}                            {gray}Scurvy diagnosis{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Development:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip create{/cyan} {gray}<template> <name>{/gray}          {gray}Build a new ship{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip run{/cyan} {gray}<script>{/gray}                      {gray}Run the sails up!{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip exec{/cyan} {gray}<cmd>{/gray}                        {gray}Execute the first mate's orders{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip link{/cyan}                              {gray}Tie the ships together{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Aliases:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip alias set{/cyan} {gray}<name> <command>{/gray}        {gray}Give 'em a new name{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias remove{/cyan} {gray}<name>{/gray}               {gray}Erase their name from history{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias list{/cyan}                           {gray}Show all crew members{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias clear{/cyan}                          {gray}Throw 'em all overboard{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Monorepo:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip workspaces list{/cyan}                   {gray}Show the fleet{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip workspaces run{/cyan} {gray}<script>{/gray}           {gray}All hands on deck!{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Maintenance:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip cache clean{/cyan}                       {gray}Scrub the decks clean{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip cache size{/cyan}                        {gray}How big be me treasure?{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip ci{/cyan}                                {gray}Prepare for battle!{/gray}\n\n","cli.update_available":"{yellow}⚓ New MIP version spotted on the horizon: {{latest}} (current: {{current}}){/yellow}\n{gray}Update: git pull && npm install && npm run build, arrr!{/gray}","commands.init.already_exists":"{yellow}⚓ A treasure map already exists!{/yellow}","commands.init.created":"{green}✅ New ship ready to sail!{/green}","commands.init.used_mip":"{gray}Built with MIP, arrr!{/gray}","commands.list.no_mip_json":"{red}❌ No treasure map found{/red}","commands.list.installed_packages":"{bold}{white}Ye Booty:{/